---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<SiteLayout title="About" description="Andrey Novikov works across analytics leadership, pricing, unit economics, data science, ML and BI.">
  <section class="about-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Make analytics useful<br /><em>in the decisions that matter.</em></h1><p class="lede">I work at the intersection of data architecture and business strategy, building analytics that helps organizations understand where they stand and what to do next.</p></div><div class="profile-mark" aria-label="Andrey Novikov"><span>AN</span><small>ANDREY NOVIKOV<br />HEAD OF ANALYTICS</small></div></section>
  <section class="bio"><div class="label">01 / The work</div><div class="copy"><p>My focus is margin and product intelligence, unit economics and real-time P&amp;L, alongside the data systems that make those questions answerable.</p><p>In one fintech case, a revenue segment was declining quickly without being visible to client-facing teams or the CFO dashboard. Detecting the change early made it possible to take targeted action before the risk grew.</p><p>With the right training, semantic layer and support from an analytics team, business users can handle a large share of recurring questions themselves. That gives analytics more room to model decisions, test assumptions and look for signals before they appear in aggregated dashboards.</p><p>Earlier in my career I worked at Microsoft, HP and EMC. Today, my focus is fintech and data-intensive SaaS.</p></div></section>
  <section class="focus"><p class="eyebrow">Areas of focus</p><div class="chips"><span>Pricing &amp; profitability</span><span>Unit economics</span><span>Product analytics</span><span>Data science &amp; ML</span><span>Business intelligence</span><span>LLM-accessible knowledge</span><span>AI agents</span></div></section>
  <section class="belief"><p class="eyebrow">A belief about analytics</p><blockquote>The deeper value is not simply automating analysis. It is helping a business become clear about what it is trying to achieve — and why.</blockquote><a class="text-link" href={`${base}/insights/`}>Explore the notes <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
 .about-hero{padding:82px 0 72px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:50px;align-items:center}.about-hero h1{font:700 clamp(42px,5.5vw,66px)/1.08 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;color:var(--navy);margin:20px 0}.about-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}.lede{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#536273;max-width:650px}.profile-mark{height:300px;background:#e8ece5;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;color:var(--navy);overflow:hidden}.profile-mark:before,.profile-mark:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:240px;height:240px;border:1px solid #142c4625;border-radius:50%}.profile-mark:after{width:180px;height:180px}.profile-mark span{font:700 74px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.08em;color:var(--blue);z-index:1}.profile-mark small{font:9px/1.7 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-align:center;z-index:1;margin-top:10px}.bio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:32px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0}.label{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em}.copy{max-width:760px}.copy p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#536273;margin:0 0 18px}.focus{padding:52px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:22px}.chips span{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#3f5266;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:2px}.belief{padding:30px;background:#e9ede8;border-left:3px solid var(--green)}.belief blockquote{font:500 26px/1.45 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--navy);margin:20px 0 24px;max-width:900px}.belief .text-link{font-size:13px}@media(max-width:720px){.about-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:60px 0;gap:28px}.profile-mark{height:230px;max-width:100%}.bio{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.belief blockquote{font-size:22px}}
</style>
